WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.960
Tim Ferriss: Hello, boys and girls, ladies&nbsp;
and germs. This is Tim Ferriss. Welcome to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.720
another episode of The Tim Ferriss&nbsp;
Show. Today, we have a repeat guest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:27.320
and good Lord did his last episode do well.&nbsp;
It did spectacularly well. You guys loved it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:32.320
So back by popular demand is Morgan Housel.&nbsp;
You can find him on Twitter @morganhousel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:38.920
H-O-U-S-E-L. He is a partner at the Collaborative&nbsp;
