He is a two time winner of the Best in Business&nbsp;
Award from the Society of American Business&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.440
Editors and Writers, and winner of the New&nbsp;
York Times Sidney Award. I might be jealous.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:01.600
I might be jealous. In 2022, MarketWatch&nbsp;
