00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.640
people in markets, good friend to have.
He serves on the board of directors at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:12.520
Markel. Morgan's new book is Same as Ever: A Guide&nbsp;
