"I realize that I no longer want to stay on&nbsp;
top of things. I want to get to the bottom of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:27.120
things." So that's phrasing that has really stuck&nbsp;
with me and maybe we'll come back to stories. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:32.920
his entire email was maybe a mini story, and had&nbsp;
an arc, and that has stuck with me for years now.&nbsp;

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:40.040
The second is, in the last few weeks I've&nbsp;
become very interested in ancient Sumer and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:49.240
dynasties in Ur and Uruk in modern day Iraq, and&nbsp;
looking at the birth of writing as we understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

