00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:46.080
do have some ideas that are so persistent that&nbsp;
I feel like it would be beneficial for me to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:51.520
write in order to think about them more clearly.
And what we didn't cover in our last conversation&nbsp;&nbsp;

