00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:09.480
be. What does it look like when you put first&nbsp;
words on paper or screen? Because that is where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:14.985
I often procrastinate facing the empty screen,&nbsp;
