it was probably the first time I had done&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:58.160 --> 00:56:02.680
something like that. And so, when you hear&nbsp;
a story about the winds changing direction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:02.680 --> 00:56:09.080
for me, it just makes you so incapable&nbsp;
of having any confidence that we know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:09.080 --> 00:56:17.120
what the future's going to bring for any of us.
