always use that book as an example as brevity does&nbsp;
not mean short, because that book is 710 pages and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:13.120 --> 01:54:19.200
every single sentence needs to be there. It's&nbsp;
about FDR and Eleanor during World War II, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

