01:54:44.520 --> 01:54:49.680
the world is on his shoulders. The decisions that&nbsp;
he makes is literally the outcome of humanity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:50.200 --> 01:54:55.080
and it was as stressful as you would imagine.
The book just goes through what he went through,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:55.080 --> 01:55:00.800
how he managed stress, who he surrounded himself&nbsp;
with, and there's so many just incredible little&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:00.800 --> 01:55:06.800
anecdotes about how he lived his life and what he&nbsp;
