01:55:27.400 --> 01:55:32.280
and he did it every day at 6:00 p.m. And I think&nbsp;
if he didn't do that, he would've lost his mind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:55:32.280 --> 01:55:37.560
It would've just been too much. There's all these&nbsp;
little anecdotes about that that I really admire.&nbsp;

