01:58:14.320 --> 01:58:19.160
and go home and face shame and humiliation, or&nbsp;
I can keep sailing and die." And then he's like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:19.160 --> 01:58:23.160
"No, actually..." He's by himself doing this.&nbsp;
In his diary, he's like, "No, there's actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:23.160 --> 01:58:28.720
a third option here, which is fraud and deceit."&nbsp;
What he did is, he turned his boat around and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:28.720 --> 01:58:34.120
he sailed right into the middle of the Atlantic&nbsp;
Ocean where the waves were very calm and placid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:34.120 --> 01:58:39.400
