It was all a scam. He was drifting aimlessly in&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:51.680 --> 01:58:57.040
the Atlantic. His plan was to kill enough time&nbsp;
doing this that he could have plausibly sailed&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:58:57.040 --> 01:59:01.200
around the world, and then, sail back to England&nbsp;
with his dignity intact and just tell people&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:59:01.200 --> 01:59:05.160
that, "Ah, I sailed around the world. I did it."
