He said it more eloquently, but that's roughly&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:00:43.600 --> 02:00:50.720
what he said. And it's true. Losing your status&nbsp;
or your internal dignity, however you want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:00:50.720 --> 02:00:58.720
